# ========================
# Ingestion data
# ========================

# Frozen snapshots are the reproducibility anchor — the raw evidence of what a source returned
# at a point in time, which cannot be regenerated once the source moves on. Pages are large, so
# only manifests are tracked by default: a manifest carries the sha256 of every page, enough to
# verify a re-fetch or an archived copy byte for byte. Un-ignore a run explicitly to track it.
backend/data/snapshots/*/*/pages/
